{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is Tears of a Dragon</h2><br>We all have inner demons that sometimes tell us to do the wrong thing.<br>Savage Dragoon is in a constant battle to conquer the darkness lurking within himself...Also known as his &quot;Dark Passenger&quot;.<br><br>Where his story ends...You Decide...<br><br>This game is based on a true story, that being my own and my constant battle against depression. Meet the people who have been a large influence in my life as well as members of my family.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple story endings for replayability<br></li><li>Your choices in the story affect the route you take<br></li><li>10 playable characters/party members<br></li><li>Free to save your game at any time! <br></li><li>More than 50 special powers and spells<br></li><li>30 unique enemies<br></li><li>More than 50 items between potions, weapons, shirts, and armour <br></li><li>Challenging dungeons to explore<br></li><li>Provide for your family by taking on mercenary work<br></li><li>Meet Savage Dragoon's Dark Passenger. Will he take control?</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f2d5cf3386a5922d60577d49b992bc940fc7fb95.jpg","localized_name":"Pia-Pia-Piano","name":"Pia-Pia-Piano","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577760/f2d5cf3386a5922d60577d49b992bc940fc7fb95.jpg"},{"icon":"62316d6a60ea0c5ad1f060e31f7cf4fffeaaee66.jpg","localized_name":"So this is my...Darkness?","name":"So this is my...Darkness?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577760/62316d6a60ea0c5ad1f060e31f7cf4fffeaaee66.jpg"},{"icon":"99f344c7304b95628e8f448daaeb57212a53f86c.jpg","localized_name":"Date Night For The Future","name":"Date Night For The Future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577760/99f344c7304b95628e8f448daaeb57212a53f86c.jpg"},{"icon":"035fba1e6f8b95b307234a62096bf90807a5eb5f.jpg","